'''First Mate Fitzsimmons''' is a [[human]] [[quest giver]] located outside [[Deepwater Tavern]] in [[Menethil Harbor]] in the [[Wetlands]]. He was once First Mate on the ''[[Wave Mistress]]'', a [[Kul Tiras (kingdom)|Kul Tiran]] ship that was destroyed by [[red dragon]]s during the [[Second War]].<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|27|The Third Fleet}}</ref> He is the sole survivor of the [[Lost Fleet]], and now spends most of his time getting drunk outside the [[Deepwater Tavern]].

