'''Flame Crest''' is a neutral outpost in the [[Burning Steppes]]. It is located on a small outcropping of rock, only accessible by crossing a crude bridge. There is a small cave in the back where [[Kibler]] lives with the talkative parrot [[Opus]]. Although it serves both factions, it serves as the Horde's flight point for the zone.

